      ":question/id": "31172075-c16d-561d-95ae-55e89a55c6ae",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x - y &=4 \\\\ 2x - y &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThis system of equations has {{field-1}}.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
